  "bio": "Hubert Napiórkowski is renowned for his exceptional skill in crafting tattoos with a distinct flair in trashpolka, realism, and black & gray styles. Working out of Cracow, Poland, Hubert has gained a reputation for his meticulous attention to detail and unwavering commitment to bring each client’s vision to life with precision and artistry. His portfolio is a testament to the high-caliber work he produces, showcasing his ability to transform skin into a canvas of bold, intricate designs.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Cracow, Woj. Małopolskie, Poland"
